    KVCache -->|"POSIX I/O<br/>KV-cache block storage"| SharedPVC["Shared PVC"]

    %% Integration Points (consumers)
    Prometheus["Prometheus"] -->|"HTTP scrape<br/>8080/TCP /metrics"| KVCache
    KVCache -->|"model downloads<br/>443/TCP HTTPS"| HFHub["HuggingFace Hub"]

